; Cash payments the owner names. A withdrawal is spent when withdrawn (`Expenses:Cash`); an entry here moves
; a cash payment from `Expenses:Cash` to its real category, so `Expenses:Cash` keeps only the cash nobody
; categorized. `kingsmint reimport` does not touch this file. The example uses made-up values.

; 2025-06-10 * "Building supplies" "Bathroom tiles, paid in cash"
;   Expenses:Home:Repairs   1200.00 EUR
;   Expenses:Cash          -1200.00 EUR
